      "content": "<p>Let R be a relation from the set <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.971ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 6617.3 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"7B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-7B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1444.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1944.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2389.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2889.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3334,0)\"><use data-c=\"2026\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2026\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4672.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5117.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6117.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"7D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-7D\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> to itself such that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18.851ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 8332.3 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1036.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2092.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"7B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-7B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2592.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2981.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3510.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3955.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4384.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5051,0)\"><use data-c=\"3A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(5606.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6313.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(7369.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(7872.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, where <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.333ex\" height=\"1.943ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -665 3241.2 859\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(503,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(947.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1685.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"2A7E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2A7E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2741.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> are prime numbers}. Then, the number of elements in R is :</p>",
